{"version":1,"content":"<p>Alinea Analytics研究員Rhys Elliott認為，《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》等少數號召力較強的作品能夠支撐80美元定價，但這一價格不會成為所有3A遊戲統一採用的新標準。本作將於11月19日推出，基礎版售價至少為80美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586390.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.142835+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"bcdf8131559388c2d20ef4411b8c05ca91e8382a9777653293a1c471081fde26","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}